RemoveProduct item;pos;shp
⍝ Removes an existing product from the inventory and updates all related product data.
pos ← ItemName⍳⊂item
shp ← ⍴ItemName

:If pos>shp
⎕←'Item not found'
:Else
ItemName ← ItemName ~ ItemName[pos]
Price ← Price ~ Price[pos]
Quantity ← Quantity ~ Quantity[pos]
Sold ← Sold~Sold[pos]
⎕←'Product removed: ' item
:EndIf
